{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years later, she discovers he lied... but why?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/8944fd27200c8312f26a197effb3eb5a.avif?t=1772168942\" width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;My Father Lied,&quot; you embark on a mysterious journey through an abandoned Mesopotamian museum. The previous inhabitants left behind intricate puzzles to help them remember their secrets and the objects they kept. What caused their memories to fade? What descended them into madness? And are you really alone in this forgotten place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/5aa0317bf441118e9b34e031d80d0a2a.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/5aa0317bf441118e9b34e031d80d0a2a.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Father Lied features the first Iraqi female-led character in a video game. In her honor, we gave her the name of the oldest known writer in human history; a woman who was also from the same region: Enheduanna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nicknamed Huda, she is an archaeologist like her father. Now, she is forced to dig into her past and the history of this place to discover what happened to him and why he was taken from them by force. To uncover the truth, she must solve puzzles left behind by those who ran this place and survive the same madness that consumed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/dadb8f9c5e98922acc48ebb2e17dbbae.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/dadb8f9c5e98922acc48ebb2e17dbbae.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features hand-drawn cutscene art that explores Huda's past and its connection to her present. The puzzles will test your reasoning, challenging you to uncover the museum's secrets\u2014from ancient and recent political intrigues to the stories of its former inhabitants, and ultimately, the truth of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember... secrets aren't found, they're earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/9c6be5af847111d40d9ea00b04a5d80f.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/9c6be5af847111d40d9ea00b04a5d80f.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what secrets your father hid from you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A BEAUTIFUL LIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/d09c0be173661474fbb238e6b476db7bf67ce86d.jpg"},{"name":"THE EPICS OF ENKIDU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/f7d2d4963f87ea861686849a20a7834b49179da4.jpg"},{"name":"THE EPICS OF ENKIDU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/42dcd49bf932097b4166a26012469228fb2bfd1a.jpg"},{"name":"SCHR\u00d6DINGER'S CAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/4a9a7572780874d06db142b20e8846b352a17525.jpg"},{"name":"THE EPICS OF ENKIDU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/92e545c1b8d49141bf20d1da1953f22f7d614004.jpg"},{"name":"THEY DON'T CARE ABOUT US","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/3120fd502c6e15acef51b789931a8b441f8a9da7.jpg"},{"name":"THE EPICS OF ENKIDU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/1d9e60a1790e784c5c47cba1146bbdf892b24613.jpg"},{"name":"HYPOTHESIS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/41afbadd59e80c315e644c7d7512f5f2c47973b7.jpg"},{"name":"FREE YOUR MIND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/f9e070fac1a3c8103a7296afc2134da98a44ed9a.jpg"},{"name":"LAST RECORD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488850/25c42f8babaab391c14299fde15313a701f90bca.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2488850?t=1772168942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772168942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/0c85c9223170833d94b10e60a1949c7f67793f83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772168942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/0c85c9223170833d94b10e60a1949c7f67793f83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772168942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is a clothes skeletal dead body found on a chair, and another skeletal body who hung itself. There is a non detailed/obscured cutscene showing a child and a mother die. No blood, only cut to black and then from far without seeing them we see fire expanding in slow motion. \r\n\r\nThere is another cutscene of a man wanting to kill himself, placing a gun on his chin, but he gets talked out of it.  "},"demos":[{"appid":2488860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years later, she discovers he lied... but why?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/8944fd27200c8312f26a197effb3eb5a.avif?t=1772168942\" width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;My Father Lied,&quot; you embark on a mysterious journey through an abandoned Mesopotamian museum. The previous inhabitants left behind intricate puzzles to help them remember their secrets and the objects they kept. What caused their memories to fade? What descended them into madness? And are you really alone in this forgotten place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/5aa0317bf441118e9b34e031d80d0a2a.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/5aa0317bf441118e9b34e031d80d0a2a.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Father Lied features the first Iraqi female-led character in a video game. In her honor, we gave her the name of the oldest known writer in human history; a woman who was also from the same region: Enheduanna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nicknamed Huda, she is an archaeologist like her father. Now, she is forced to dig into her past and the history of this place to discover what happened to him and why he was taken from them by force. To uncover the truth, she must solve puzzles left behind by those who ran this place and survive the same madness that consumed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/dadb8f9c5e98922acc48ebb2e17dbbae.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/dadb8f9c5e98922acc48ebb2e17dbbae.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features hand-drawn cutscene art that explores Huda's past and its connection to her present. The puzzles will test your reasoning, challenging you to uncover the museum's secrets\u2014from ancient and recent political intrigues to the stories of its former inhabitants, and ultimately, the truth of what lies beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember... secrets aren't found, they're earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/9c6be5af847111d40d9ea00b04a5d80f.poster.avif?t=1772168942\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/extras/9c6be5af847111d40d9ea00b04a5d80f.webm?t=1772168942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what secrets your father hid from you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LUNAR GAMES LTD"],"dlc":[4318130],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488850/8be86c7b8a4a969689df19e6307932e3c13802bd/header.jpg?t=1772168942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2488850/605496894/706b7e716370c3d3a80e60ce9b60769d0ca18774/1768145012/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768148065","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2488850/605496894/706b7e716370c3d3a80e60ce9b60769d0ca18774/1768145012/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768148065","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2488850/605496894/706b7e716370c3d3a80e60ce9b60769d0ca18774/1768145012/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768148065","id":257227216,"name":"My Father Lied Sumerian Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227216/c4c69f8731f1d5d2c4ea20e04234d210537f0d10/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768148065"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2488850/868006/ffb4dc6b65dc55dfb06e0f18dc6034a27e0d725b/1750924308/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744354276","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2488850/868006/ffb4dc6b65dc55dfb06e0f18dc6034a27e0d7